"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"History: Version comparison","spec":{"accessibility":["The close and compare buttons have accessible names; each change names its operation in words, and color is never the only signal.","Images carry alternative text that names the Asset."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Button, ListItem, DiffItem, Image, Alert, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except Workspace content and diff values (resource names, Widget IDs, JSON pointers, values, member nicknames); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","The Image Widgets bind the dogfood Workspace image Asset test-icon on both sides, because a View binds one Asset revision: the real panel shows the two stored revisions.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person chose a version in the History panel of a View, as a member who holds history.read; the panel compares that View with the version before it.","The base state compares an autosave with its parent: one changed resource, the View, whose diff opens at once. The Variants show the other compare targets, a first version, no differences, an Asset image change, loading and failure.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the column is the panel content, about 340px wide in the Workbench."],"intent":"Show a comparison in the View page History panel as built from Adapter Widgets only: the two compared versions, the compare-with choices, the summary of the changed resources and, per resource, the semantic diff the server computed, with Restore this version and the canvas mode choice.","interactionRules":["A version can be compared with its previous version or with the current state; the summary lists each changed resource with its status, and a resource opens its semantic diff.","The diff of a View lists name and feature changes, Widgets added, removed, moved or changed in config, Variants and their State overrides, and Spec items; every value is shown as written and is never translated.","An Asset change shows its image before and after beside the content digest change.","Restore this version is offered on desktop to a holder of history.restore and the resource write key; the canvas before and after choice is offered on tablet and desktop.","Closing the comparison returns to the timeline."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d701-6e2b-4f3a-9d5c-2b7e1f8a0c01"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-0d1c-7265-9058-72bef4da2b1a","01a11a5e-0d72-7895-87e2-42f097ba41c9","01a11a5e-11e0-7f39-84a7-fde3faa43340","01a11a5e-0ddc-7d9d-83b9-5366d0ac44dd","01a11a5e-0e37-754b-bea2-a15716749c0c","01a11a5e-0edf-7ea0-8d15-cc2a028d2a14","01a11a5e-0f31-7635-aeb2-16a1e9673b20","01a11a5e-18f2-7991-8f7d-aa4c8015d14a","01a11a5e-1bfa-71e9-9611-152b5b665379","01a11e0d-d550-78e4-9787-f0023bbc1b93","01a11a5e-1ba5-765e-966f-a681def5f472","01a11a5e-1afd-79e8-bfe8-8c0eccfaa396"]},"variants":{"compare-error":{"state":{"failed-alert":{"visible":true},"result":{"visible":false}}},"compare-first-version":{"state":{"article-view":{"visible":false},"sides-first":{"visible":true},"sides-parent":{"visible":false},"summary-added":{"visible":true},"summary-noparent-text":{"visible":true},"summary-view":{"visible":false}}},"compare-loading":{"state":{"loading":{"visible":true},"result":{"visible":false}}},"compare-no-differences":{"state":{"articles":{"visible":false},"summary-count-one-text":{"visible":false},"summary-count-zero-text":{"visible":true},"summary-links":{"visible":false},"summary-list":{"visible":false},"summary-same-text":{"visible":true}}},"compare-with-current":{"requirements":["01a11a